    "https://millsaps-csm.symplicity.com/students": {
      "title": "Sign In",
      "description": "Sign in Skip to content Skip to main menu Skip to secondary menu Help Accessibility Mode: Off Use this link to improve screen reader compatibility. If you are a current student and receive an error that your account is \"blocked because they are not a direct member of the group with access,\" please return to the login page and select Alumni And Other Users instead of Current Students. Sign In Please select a sign in method Or Alumni and others: Username Don't have an account? Sign Up Sign In Current Millsaps College Students, please enter your school username and password. Username (Your email address) Password You have not logged in from using this device before. Please enter your PIN below to verfy your identity. If access to this device is limited, (not a shared computer), you may enter a device name below and skip this step in the future. Please enter your PIN Remember this device by name (Example: Work Computer) Choose a device name Forgot Password (for Alumni) Forgot PIN By clicking Major Careers Sign in, you agree that your use of the system is governed by your institution's privacy policies and our Privacy Policy and Terms Register Alumni, please register for a new  Major Careers account. Take your career search mobile"
